  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-nas-workspace-support",
      "text": "This release requires DSH 0.2.1-alpha.1 or a compatible 0.2 release. See [compatibility details](docs/dsh-0.2-compatibility.md).\n\n为 NAS 工作区提供可配置的路径映射与打开行为。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "锁定公开仓库的提交后，通过 DSH 官方入口安装：\n\n```powershell\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:vb2250158/dsh-nas-workspace-support#<commit>\n```\n\n插件包声明 `dsh.bundle`，安装后会把自己的配置层加入 profile。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "插件配置保存在 DSH profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml`。多电脑同步仓库只保存仓库地址、固定提交、启停状态和配置，不保存本仓库源码。"
    },
    {
      "section": "验证",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm test\nnpm pack --dry-run\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin display metadata",
      "text": "The plugin list shows **NAS workspaces** in English and **NAS 工作区** in Chinese, following the DSH interface language. `locale/en.json` and `locale/zh.json` provide the title and description; `icon.svg` supplies self-contained artwork. The package exports and publishes these resources. The icon is adapted from Lucide; see [ICON_LICENSE.txt](ICON_LICENSE.txt).\n\nThe icon uses a centered 36 × 36 viewBox to leave more space around the artwork inside the plugin icon frame."
    }
  ],
